{
  "info": {
    "name": "Notification campaigns",
    "description": "Async bulk email campaigns demo, organised by acceptance criterion. Run the app with the demo profile for snappy timings: ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=demo'. Folders: 1) the happy path with all simulator behaviours, 2) each simulator behaviour isolated (success / temporary error with retry / permanent rejection / bounded retries), 3) validation and consistency rules, 4) the exactly-once verification via the deliveries endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
